    "forecast": "critical",
    "rationale": "Manual validation only; scripts could not be run in this environment. Present inherent risk is driven by an untrusted supplier invoice reaching S3 payment scheduling and S2 bank-update capabilities under broad ERP credentials. Residual remains high overall because the only declared preventive control is a human approval gate that shows a model summary at high volume; under rubric section 5 step 2 that lowers the payment path by one tier only and cannot outperform raw low-volume approval. Forecast returns to critical if model upgrades, autonomy increases, or the approval control is removed, because the summary gate is the single control whose decay most increases risk."
  },
